msgstr ""
"**高擎 Panthera HT** — [ht-ros2-control README](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/ht-ros2-control/blob/main/README.md)："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:61
#: 2acfa5165ec34ef694995f21d628ca7c
msgid "HI `control_mode:=mit` (default; older name `full_control` still accepted)"
msgstr "HI `control_mode:=mit`（默认；旧名 `full_control` 仍可用）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:62
#: 6792da92a6394ad386f9a169025476c4
msgid ""
"The driver sends position + velocity + effort + kp/kd "
"(`pos_vel_tqe_kp_kd`)"
msgstr "驱动下发位置 + 速度 + 力矩 + kp/kd（`pos_vel_tqe_kp_kd`）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:63
#: 40a778763fe34c52a763b3ccc1c815ca
msgid ""
"Stiffness is HI parameters `joint_kp` / `joint_kd` (rqt / `ros2 param`), "
"**not** kp/kd command interfaces"
msgstr "刚度是 HI 参数 `joint_kp` / `joint_kd`（rqt / `ros2 param`），**不是** kp/kd 命令接口"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:64
#: 6a0c4210658e424aa47a71100173406f
msgid ""
"Other documented HI modes: `effort` (torque only), `position` (position "
"only)"
msgstr "文档中的其他 HI 模式：`effort`（仅力矩）、`position`（仅位置）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:66
#: ced9ffe0210a4ba0a5755b88ea57fa92
msgid ""
"**ARX arms** — [arx-ros2-control README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/arx-ros2-control/blob/main/README.md):"
msgstr ""
"**方舟无限机械臂** — [arx-ros2-control README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/arx-ros2-control/blob/main/README.md)："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:68
#: 78875d2a46d84f35b42d7cb64a3b3778
msgid ""
"Arms support only `full_control` / MIT MIX. Other `control_mode` values "
"in xacro are warned and ignored"
msgstr "机械臂只支持 `full_control` / MIT MIX。xacro 里写的其他 `control_mode` 会告警并被忽略"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:69
#: eb64cb251bff4c37974382f60aa3dfc5
msgid "`write()` always sends position + velocity + effort"
msgstr "`write()` 始终下发位置 + 速度 + 力矩"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:70
#: 1c781592b9134295aec359130445179d
msgid ""
"MIT `kp` / `kd` come from HI `joint_k_gains` / `joint_d_gains` (no kp/kd "
"command interface)"
msgstr "MIT 的 `kp` / `kd` 来自 HI 的 `joint_k_gains` / `joint_d_gains`（没有 kp/kd 命令接口）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:71
#: fae66a8b3af04263801b89650aec7ba8
msgid ""
"README mapping: OCS2 trajectory → position; OCS2 `future_input` → "
"velocity; OCS2 effort → gravity / static feedforward torque"
msgstr "README 映射：OCS2 轨迹 → 位置；OCS2 `future_input` → 速度；OCS2 力矩 → 重力 / 静力学前馈力矩"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:73
#: 37de534aba4048d5a8ce3deaa0b44523
msgid ""
"**Controller** — [ocs2_arm_controller README — Interface "
"Configuration](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/controller/ocs2_arm_controller/README.md):"
msgstr ""
"**控制器** — [ocs2_arm_controller README — Interface "
"Configuration](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/controller/ocs2_arm_controller/README.md)："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:75
#: 6b018a4a738d45fea4cb7f1b87bd87a8
msgid ""
"Mode is **auto-detected** from the robot config (no extra launch flag "
"named `force:=`)"
msgstr "模式由机器人配置**自动检测**（没有名为 `force:=` 的额外 launch 参数）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:76
#: d76504e9e8424f978900ad7bc1eb4758
msgid "Position-only: command `position`; state `position` + `velocity`"
msgstr "仅位置：命令 `position`；状态 `position` + `velocity`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:77
#: f67eaf4f83a94c27890f2b7da808613a
msgid ""
"Force / MIX: command `position`, `velocity`, `effort`, `kp`, `kd` all "
"present; YAML `force_gains` is `[kp, kd]`"
msgstr ""
"力控 / MIX：命令接口同时具备 `position`、`velocity`、`effort`、`kp`、`kd`；YAML "
"`force_gains` 为 `[kp, kd]`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:78
#: 4854e27153b14c1aafd5ec0ab0ef483e
msgid ""
"ARX documents OCS2 MIX as pos + vel + effort with kp/kd on the HI. HT "
"notes that when kp/kd are **not** command interfaces, OCS2 may stay in "
"position mode; gravity compensation then uses `ht_gravity_compensation` "
"or larger `joint_kp` (same HT README)"
msgstr ""
"方舟无限文档把 OCS2 MIX 写成位置 + 速度 + 力矩，kp/kd 在 HI 上。高擎说明：当 kp/kd "
"**不是**命令接口时，OCS2 可能停在位置模式；重力补偿改用 `ht_gravity_compensation` 或调大 "
"`joint_kp`（同一份 HT README）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:80
#: dc2d8851cef64ee3bd8e4837addd01bc
msgid ""
"Bring the robot up with the lean-branch `./quick_start.sh` / "
"`hardware:=real` path on [HighTorque Panthera "
"HT](../6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md) or [ARX Lift "
"2S](../6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md), then start VR as"
" below."
msgstr ""
"先按精简分支的 `./quick_start.sh` / `hardware:=real` 拉起机器人：[高擎 Panthera "
"HT](../6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md) 或 [方舟无限 Lift "
"2S](../6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md)，再按下文启动 VR。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:82
#: a6d1886e468d4803bfd678a8b3feaba7
msgid ""
"This MIT path is **not** isomorphic teleop. Master–slave `mode:=mit` / "
"`effort` on Panthera HT is [Isomorphic Teleop](7-isomorphic_teleop.md)."
msgstr ""
"这条 MIT 路径**不是**同构遥操作。Panthera HT 上主从 `mode:=mit` / `effort` "
"见[同构遥操作](7-isomorphic_teleop.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:84
#: f5334b18f56f4d3abd62eba319d351f9
msgid "Vendor joint impedance (Tianji / Rokae)"
msgstr "厂商关节阻抗（天玑 / 珞石）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:86
#: e8734a8511694ec09ad85419a468dd78
msgid ""
"Use this path on **Tianji** (天玑) and **Rokae** (珞石). The controller only "
"sends **joint position**. Joint impedance / compliance is the **vendor** "
"feature, switched on the hardware interface."
msgstr "此路径用于 **天玑** 与 **珞石**。控制器只发 **关节位置**。关节阻抗 / 柔顺是**厂商**能力，在驱动层上切换。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:88
#: 5b6a33514d2d419582b825685482e998
msgid ""
"**Tianji** — [marvin-ros2-control README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/marvin-ros2-control/blob/master/README.md):"
msgstr ""
"**天玑** — [marvin-ros2-control README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/marvin-ros2-control/blob/master/README.md)："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:90
#: 0e2b931b60db49d39a7c4ebcfc5a3f36
msgid ""
"Command interfaces: joint **`position` only**. State: `position`, "
"`velocity`, `effort`"
msgstr "命令接口：关节 **仅 `position`**。状态：`position`、`velocity`、`effort`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:91
#: b70dc5883f2d439fade893e00f2b7393
msgid ""
"Runtime `ctrl_mode`: `POSITION` / `JOINT_IMPEDANCE` / `CART_IMPEDANCE` / "
"`POWER_OFF`"
msgstr ""
"运行时 `ctrl_mode`：`POSITION` / `JOINT_IMPEDANCE` / `CART_IMPEDANCE` / "
"`POWER_OFF`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:92
#: ef29444d589943f69f759feaa70e6961
msgid ""
"Joint impedance gains: `joint_k_gains` / `joint_d_gains` (7 values). "
"Cartesian: `cart_k_gains` / `cart_d_gains`"
msgstr ""
"关节阻抗增益：`joint_k_gains` / `joint_d_gains`（7 维）。笛卡尔：`cart_k_gains` / "
"`cart_d_gains`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:93
#: 6ec6cb3824f04f2bb7fc3a0f3c15a83b
msgid "Example: `ros2 param set /<hardware_node> ctrl_mode JOINT_IMPEDANCE`"
msgstr "示例：`ros2 param set /<hardware_node> ctrl_mode JOINT_IMPEDANCE`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:95
#: 09728f4ae9f643ef971f1f5c4d3cb982
msgid ""
"**Rokae** — same pattern (position commands; compliance in the vendor "
"HI). Parameter names are in the private `rokae-ros2-control` README after"
" access. Overview: [Hardware "
"Interfaces](../../4-reference/hardware/0-index.md)."
msgstr ""
"**珞石** — 同一模式（位置命令；柔顺在厂商驱动层）。参数名在开通后的私有 `rokae-ros2-control` "
"README。概览：[驱动层](../../4-reference/hardware/0-index.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:97
#: 7b35adc32ce142e2bbc0c7455b81b5b6
msgid ""
"Internal FA robots that use Tianji / Rokae arms live in [fa-deploy-ws "
"Setup](../../1-getting_started/4-fa_deploy_ws.md). Extra robot IDs and "
"launch flags are in that workspace README after access."
msgstr ""
"使用天玑 / 珞石臂的内部 FA 机器人见 [fa-deploy-ws "
"配置](../../1-getting_started/4-fa_deploy_ws.md)。额外机器人 ID 和 launch "
"参数在开通后的该仓库 README。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:99
#: 14bbc3ab4aab4c1391b7add6071a1f75
msgid "Payload identification (负载辨识)"
msgstr "负载辨识"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:101
#: e875c9da0ba249029bca78e927a0266e
msgid ""
"负载辨识 is **only** on the Tianji / Rokae (vendor impedance) path. It is not"
" an MIT / OCS2 `force_gains` procedure."
msgstr "负载辨识**只**在天玑 / 珞石（厂商阻抗）路径上。它不是 MIT / OCS2 `force_gains` 流程。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:103
#: ba7aba1456114225b7eab31f75277c88
msgid ""
"**Public, verified Tianji wizard** (semi-automatic tool-dynamics ID on "
"CCS): [marvin-ros2-control "
"`scripts/tool_dyn_identify_wizard.py`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/marvin-ros2-control/blob/master/scripts/tool_dyn_identify_wizard.py), "
"installed as `ros2 run marvin_ros2_control tool_dyn_identify_wizard` "
"(`CMakeLists.txt` `install(PROGRAMS … RENAME tool_dyn_identify_wizard)`)."
msgstr ""
"**已核实的公开天玑向导**（CCS 上半自动工具动力学辨识）：[marvin-ros2-control "
"`scripts/tool_dyn_identify_wizard.py`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/marvin-"
"ros2-control/blob/master/scripts/tool_dyn_identify_wizard.py)，安装后为 `ros2 "
"run marvin_ros2_control tool_dyn_identify_wizard`（`CMakeLists.txt` 的 "
"`install(PROGRAMS … RENAME tool_dyn_identify_wizard)`）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:105
#: 07f8b4f9b641476eb1007b867a416964
msgid ""
"The wizard banner is **机械臂负载辨识向导（工具动力学参数辨识 / CCS）**. It connects to the "
"Marvin controller IP, collects no-load then loaded PVT trajectories, and "
"prints 10-D tool dynamics (`m, mx, my, mz, ixx, …`). Those values match "
"HI parameters `left_dyn_param` / `right_dyn_param` on the same README."
msgstr ""
"向导标题是**机械臂负载辨识向导（工具动力学参数辨识 / CCS）**。它连接 Marvin 控制器 IP，先采空载再采带载 PVT 轨迹，并打印"
" 10 维工具动力学（`m, mx, my, mz, ixx, …`）。这些值对应同一 README 里的 HI 参数 "
"`left_dyn_param` / `right_dyn_param`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:107
#: b3f3207f37aa4b67b5460b0d72d06ebb
msgid ""
"There is **no** public `open-deploy-ws` payload-ID flow. Internal on-site"
" Tianji payload identification is in the private **fa-deploy-ws** README "
"after access (default branch is typically `fa-w2`). Use that README’s "
"script names — they are not listed here."
msgstr ""
"公开的 `open-deploy-ws` **没有**负载辨识流程。内部现场天玑负载辨识在开通后的私有 **fa-deploy-ws** "
"README（默认分支通常是 `fa-w2`）。脚本名以该 README 为准，这里不列出。"

