#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:165
#: 34f5290fee1b4c00a76d6707465a0b6b 624d5138f27f4ae6a4df14523e0076ad
msgid "Action"
msgstr "动作"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:165
#: 380f29188d474f819bb6921ad51d0bc1
msgid "Trigger"
msgstr "扳机"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:165
#: 8b589bd8030345deafe582f3cc70fbc2
msgid ""
"Gripper — pull for proportional open/close; in open/close mode, tap "
"toggles"
msgstr "夹爪 — 按拉动比例开合；开合模式下点按切换"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:165
#: 5f16d3228c864536918482965744d024
msgid "Right **A** / left **X**"
msgstr "右 **A** / 左 **X**"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:165
#: 555b3435dc46406b97d7caeab7a4d232
msgid ""
"FSM forward (`HOLD`→`OCS2`, `HOME`→`HOLD`) / back (`OCS2`→`HOLD`, "
"`HOLD`→`HOME`)"
msgstr "FSM 前进（`HOLD`→`OCS2`，`HOME`→`HOLD`）/ 后退（`OCS2`→`HOLD`，`HOLD`→`HOME`）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:165
#: e4727b27b1bb4fd5833b4932456d8e19
msgid "Left stick click"
msgstr "左摇杆点击"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:165
#: e47d9ffc637b44c79efeab33468930fd
msgid "Mirror"
msgstr "镜像"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:165
#: 3a7839c229b64820b5bda1bd166f8eb1
msgid "Right stick click"
msgstr "右摇杆点击"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:165
#: fb18088c359940ab8f85a3f4f5403072
msgid "`STORAGE` ↔ `UPDATE` (**OCS2 only**)"
msgstr "`STORAGE` ↔ `UPDATE`（**仅 OCS2**）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:165
#: f08c33f7452d44399fa03123ed1eb6a8
msgid "Grip (short press)"
msgstr "握把（短按）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:165
#: 409ab575c9aa48aab97528982aeaa13d
msgid "Toggle stick plane (`XY` ↔ `Z+Yaw`)"
msgstr "切换摇杆平面（`XY` ↔ `Z+Yaw`）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:165
#: 0b618aec77794fb49e54b80c8cfe82a6
msgid "Left **Y** / right **B**"
msgstr "左 **Y** / 右 **B**"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:165
#: 0d12153e812c4f2db39e388c67a568cf
msgid ""
"Per-arm: **分体** = VR pause/resume (停发指令). **全身** default = that arm’s WBC"
" ENABLE/DISABLE (停单臂); after event 16, same pause/resume. See [Stop one "
"arm vs stop sending VR commands](#stop-one-arm-vs-stop-sending-vr-"
"commands)."
msgstr ""
"按臂：**分体** = VR 暂停/恢复（停发指令）。**全身** 默认 = 该臂 WBC `ENABLE`/`DISABLE`（停单臂）；事件"
" 16 之后变为同样的暂停/恢复。见 [停单臂 vs 停发指令](#stop-one-arm-vs-stop-sending-vr-"
"commands)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:211
#: 247a1183213140a78b10ba17722eb11f
msgid "**全身** adds grip + stick (ignored in 分体; FSM must already be **OCS2**):"
msgstr "**全身** 额外提供握把 + 摇杆（分体下忽略；FSM 须已在 **OCS2**）："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:165
#: a56ec3624e2549d38940cf372cca5fa2
msgid "Left grip + left stick"
msgstr "左握把 + 左摇杆"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:165
#: 745ca1425e1a494f8657d2a979012e08
msgid "Body: up = upright, down = lock waist, left = follow, right = custom lock"
msgstr "身体：上 = 竖直，下 = 锁定腰部，左 = 跟随，右 = 自定义锁定"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:165
#: 797048a3587b4ac998fef8476914cb33
msgid "Right grip + right stick"
msgstr "右握把 + 右摇杆"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:165
#: 7830e9c373c74c07a75dd17443c94c69
msgid ""
"WBC: up = dual-arm couple on/off, down = chassis unlock/lock, left = "
"reserved, right = reference-joint track"
msgstr "WBC：上 = 双臂耦合开/关，下 = 底盘解锁/锁定，左 = 预留，右 = 参考关节追踪"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:165
#: 1befbfd207e1445798e892b4719ccbf5
msgid "Both grips + left **Y** + right **B**"
msgstr "双手握把 + 左 **Y** + 右 **B**"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:165
#: dc50aad1fb624e53987fde5890be7207
msgid "Event 16: toggle the Y/B latch between WBC arm disable and VR pause/resume"
msgstr "事件 16：把 **Y**/**B** 锁存在 WBC 停单臂与 VR 停发指令之间切换"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:219
#: b673bf2c68b14b19b5400f974e33e8c7
msgid ""
"Grip + same-hand trigger switches that trigger’s gripper between percent "
"and open/close. Pressing left **Y** and right **B** together (no grips) "
"is scale-align (turns mirror off and returns to `STORAGE`). Both sticks "
"together toggle chassis teleop ↔ end-effector control."
msgstr ""
"握把 + 同侧扳机切换该扳机所映射夹爪的百分比 / 开合模式。同时按下左 **Y** 和右 **B**（不按握把）为尺度对齐（关闭镜像并退回 "
"`STORAGE`）。左右摇杆同时按下切换底盘遥控 ↔ 末端控制。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:221
#: 9405c5e1c93349ab9ff71530fbcc5a0b
msgid "Stop one arm vs stop sending VR commands"
msgstr "停单臂 vs 停发指令"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:223
#: 98fbc4b5c0fa42ad886a40e875228de9
msgid "停单臂 vs 停发指令"
msgstr "停单臂 vs 停发指令"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:226
#: b1acc93d12494386b37611eafe211ebe
msgid ""
"On **全身**, default left **Y** / right **B** requests that arm’s WBC "
"ENABLE/DISABLE (**停单臂**). That is not the same as freezing VR input for "
"that arm (**停发指令** / pause). Event 16 flips which of those two Y/B does."
msgstr ""
"在**全身**下，默认左 **Y** / 右 **B** 向 WBC 请求该臂 `ENABLE`/`DISABLE`（**停单臂**）。这与冻结该臂的 "
"VR 输入（**停发指令**）不是一回事。事件 16 切换 **Y**/**B** 当前属于哪一种。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:229
#: 7cf3e7bfd18e4a2db6545c5dacd87e31
msgid ""
"Y/B disable and event 16 apply when **全身** is active "
"(`ocs2_wbc_controller`), VR is enabled, and FSM is **OCS2**. "
"Implementation: [VRInputHandler README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/b55274481140ceb6e3e694ea4777b7fdd4cfa433/command/arms_target_manager/VR_INPUT_HANDLER_README.md)"
" (「单臂启用 / 禁用与 Y/B 语义锁存」)."
msgstr ""
"**Y**/**B** 停单臂与事件 16 仅在**全身**已激活（`ocs2_wbc_controller`）、已启用 VR、且 FSM 为 "
"**OCS2** 时生效。实现见 [VRInputHandler README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/b55274481140ceb6e3e694ea4777b7fdd4cfa433/command/arms_target_manager/VR_INPUT_HANDLER_README.md)"
"（「单臂启用 / 禁用与 **Y**/**B** 语义锁存」）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:223
#: 7fbe923f360f45f79fc07666d8d1cd02
msgid "What you want"
msgstr "目的"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:223
#: e609f3ee983d4b878d7a8784a7547f23
msgid "Result"
msgstr "结果"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:223
#: f950ed076eb34011a40436b1d5642429
msgid "**Stop one arm** (停单臂)"
msgstr "**停单臂**"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:223
#: 62991357c4164f6ea069d265ccc65783
msgid "Default left **Y** / right **B**"
msgstr "默认左 **Y** / 右 **B**"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:223
#: 576ec1a5171f4d4296b11c54e5d088f9
msgid ""
"Request that arm’s WBC ENABLE/DISABLE. After WBC confirms `ARM_DISABLED`,"
" VR stops publishing pose to that arm and stops accumulating that arm’s "
"stick offset. The other arm stays controllable. Re-enable rebases from "
"the current robot pose and the current headset / controller pose, then "
"clears that arm’s stick offset. Does not require `UPDATE` / `STORAGE`."
msgstr ""
"向 WBC 请求该臂 `ENABLE`/`DISABLE`。WBC 确认 `ARM_DISABLED` 后，VR "
"停止向该臂发布位姿，也不再累积该臂摇杆偏移。另一臂仍可控制。重新启用时从当前机器人位姿和当前头显/手柄位姿重新对齐基准，并清零该臂摇杆偏移。不要求处于"
" `UPDATE` / `STORAGE`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:223
#: 80d82666020649fc94dcc04c0e68a68a
msgid "**Stop sending VR commands** (停发指令)"
msgstr "**停发指令**"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:223
#: fb635707855f45d98c9433e1a000b283
msgid "After event 16, same left **Y** / right **B**"
msgstr "事件 16 之后，仍是左 **Y** / 右 **B**"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:223
#: ba0e2b72c55a4d46b77421b490d9bf0d
msgid "Freeze / resume VR input for that arm (pause). Needs `UPDATE`."
msgstr "冻结 / 恢复该臂的 VR 输入。需要 `UPDATE`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:223
#: 5e99dbeb5fec4c7197981f34a4e88624
msgid "Switch Y/B meaning"
msgstr "切换 **Y**/**B** 含义"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:223
#: 9ad458a67a5d4bb7a5213f20046808bc
msgid "Event 16: both grips + left **Y** + right **B**"
msgstr "事件 16：双手握把 + 左 **Y** + 右 **B**"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:223
#: a77689ddfdae4872b2d30d4b708da5a6
msgid "Latch toggles between “WBC arm disable” and “VR pause/resume”."
msgstr "锁存在「WBC 停单臂」与「VR 停发指令」之间切换。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:237
#: bd72c6e732d94477ae0a9952b977b503
msgid "**分体** ignores event 16. Left **Y** / right **B** stay VR pause/resume."
msgstr "**分体**忽略事件 16。左 **Y** / 右 **B** 始终是 VR 停发指令（暂停/恢复）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:239
#: 9953e61024784f5192fd7b085f2aa7ce
msgid ""
"Mirror swaps which physical button maps to which arm. WBC "
"enabled/disabled state and rebase stay on the real arm."
msgstr "镜像只交换物理按键到机械臂的映射。WBC 启用/禁用状态与重新对齐始终按实际机械臂保存。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:241
#: 2658cee4defe4e76b59df3ea5df2e464
msgid ""
"When event 16 switches to pause and that arm is already `ARM_DISABLED`, "
"the handler requests ENABLE, rebases, then freezes as paused. When it "
"switches back to disable and that arm is already VR-paused, it requests "
"DISABLE, then clears pause after WBC confirms. Under pause semantics, "
"entering `UPDATE` with the right stick click does not clear the pause."
msgstr ""
"事件 16 切到停发指令且该臂已是 `ARM_DISABLED` 时，会先请求 `ENABLE`，重新对齐后再冻结为暂停。切回停单臂且该臂已处于 "
"VR 暂停时，会请求 `DISABLE`，WBC 确认禁用后再清除暂停。处于停发指令语义时，点右摇杆进入 `UPDATE` 不会清除暂停。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:243
#: 465b90d253c34c239f9f48e80b81f9d7
msgid "Constraints on **全身**:"
msgstr "**全身**约束："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:245
#: 1225d23ed52d456f845175c656eadabd
msgid "While the arms are coupled, Y/B cannot toggle a single arm."
msgstr "双臂已耦合时，**Y**/**B** 不能单独切换任一臂。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:246
#: 76780de64d004bae8662579aafa75dfa
msgid "You cannot enable couple while any arm is disabled."
msgstr "任一臂处于禁用时，不能开启双臂耦合。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:247
#: cd5aa3fe4b234892a5748d1b9fb9887d
msgid ""
"While coupled, event 16 cannot switch the latch from pause back to "
"disable (the latch stays)."
msgstr "耦合期间，事件 16 不能把锁存从停发指令切回停单臂（锁存不变）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:248
#: 2e5be55e2cc54292a931d1c8d40c65c2
msgid ""
"While a WBC switch or an event-16 conversion is still pending, event 16 "
"and Y/B are ignored."
msgstr "WBC 开关或事件 16 转换仍在等待确认时，事件 16 与 **Y**/**B** 均被忽略。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:249
#: ebd238d217a04f05be3a61e98a884412
msgid ""
"If the topology leaves 全身, the latch returns to the default disable "
"meaning."
msgstr "控制拓扑离开全身后，锁存回到默认的停单臂含义。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:251
#: 54aa4f9eed6b4ef19fdb28820337da52
msgid "Safety"
msgstr "安全"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:253
#: 21ab2c43733f45b39e27f6a5241988c1
msgid "Motion Limits"
msgstr "运动限制"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:256
#: 15b99ec3f0c14755ba29a27e663bc653
msgid "VR teleoperation can command rapid motions. When using real hardware:"
msgstr "VR 遥操作可能发出快速运动指令。使用真实硬件时："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:257
#: 2a920bfa9e224206b4196efd6dddcdf1
msgid "Start with low speed limits"
msgstr "从较低速度限制开始"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:258
#: 88948c4f3aa942a097bc14986b4dd1dd
msgid "Keep hand on emergency stop"
msgstr "手放在急停开关上"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:259
#: c54fe2f3a3af4e42b2cc3efe64c2e617
msgid "Clear the robot workspace"
msgstr "清空机器人工作空间"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:260
#: a7ddfc19d42849518c7cc8942d6e3ac1
msgid "Use workspace limits in software"
msgstr "在软件中使用工作空间限位"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:263
#: 1a9fa71eec1a45f6aed1600136e63c30
msgid "Network Setup"
msgstr "网络设置"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:265
#: 32afa838371748bcb1b719f8ed6fca0b
msgid ""
"The headset and the ROS 2 PC must be on a reachable network (same Domain "
"ID; Zenoh or DDS as needed)."
msgstr "头显与 ROS 2 主机必须处于可达网络（相同 Domain ID；按需使用 Zenoh 或 DDS）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:267
#: 97cc8ae66e4645a2afe6f13d533f47df
msgid ""
"**Pico Enterprise:** USB shared networking (USB 网络共享) is supported — "
"tether the headset to the PC over USB so they share a network. Follow the"
" headset’s own USB-network UI; this page does not list ADB or `usb0` "
"commands."
msgstr ""
"**Pico 企业版：** 支持 USB 网络共享 — 用 USB 将头显连接到电脑以共享网络。按头显自带的 USB 网络界面操作；本页不列出 "
"ADB 或 `usb0` 命令。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:268
#: d275abffffbf472cb4da9f5042ea91ee
msgid ""
"**Pico consumer / Meta Quest:** use the usual Wi-Fi (or other IP) path. "
"Do not assume USB 网络共享."
msgstr "**Pico 消费版 / Meta Quest：** 使用常规 Wi-Fi（或其他 IP）路径。不要假定有 USB 网络共享。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:270
#: 8ce3b6deec43451ab64a09713b257c88
msgid "Then:"
msgstr "然后："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:272
#: 8a524ff56352491486b7945e703919c5
msgid "Confirm both devices can reach each other"
msgstr "确认两台设备能够互相访问"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:273
#: 212146655cde46d8aba371250cc1f31a
msgid "Configure ROS 2 domain or Zenoh bridge if they are not on one LAN"
msgstr "若不在同一局域网，配置 ROS 2 Domain 或 Zenoh 桥接"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:274
#: 4af1ce8f9cb54eadb85d6b5e65a7bdb6
msgid "Set firewall rules for ROS 2 ports"
msgstr "为 ROS 2 端口设置防火墙规则"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:276
#: 48039264c1f344468f24c9174ddb9cff
msgid "Verification"
msgstr "验证"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:278
#: dc648859183549c08bc7c56b958910da
msgid "VR bridge logs show tracking data"
msgstr "VR 桥接日志显示追踪数据"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:279
#: a83a7b16ee9c4e4582d3873124a92414
msgid "`ros2 topic echo /teleop/right_ee_pose` shows updates"
msgstr "`ros2 topic echo /teleop/right_ee_pose` 有更新"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:280
#: 86719e89802142d29ac9e08712da173c
msgid "Robot follows VR controller motion"
msgstr "机器人跟随 VR 手柄运动"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:282
#: 2fa81a8a2dc149898bb6ddd3bbf6109e
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排除"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:284
#: 1f9f2907539b4bdfb725e1d51201cad0
msgid "No tracking data"
msgstr "没有追踪数据"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:286
#: bb5b614ef3e04e2db76b0f7836c4ab45
msgid "Check VR device is properly tracked"
msgstr "确认 VR 设备追踪正常"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:287
#: 2c4c432eeb44434f842b93ea9ed98e77
msgid "Verify browser/app has WebXR permissions"
msgstr "确认浏览器/应用已获得 WebXR 权限"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:288
#: 37d52eaaf99546da91474524fa06711d
msgid "Check network (Wi-Fi, or USB 网络共享 on Pico Enterprise)"
msgstr "检查网络（Wi-Fi，或 Pico 企业版上的 USB 网络共享）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:289
#: a3df2f0040684d58b4b66594e508318f
msgid "Confirm the headset App matches the Pico edition (Enterprise vs consumer)"
msgstr "确认头显 App 与 Pico 版本匹配（企业版 vs 消费版）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:291
#: f7ee15b234d9424e858f8e17214da20f
msgid "High latency"
msgstr "延迟较高"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:293
#: 8399322bd2e74c8ea05785bd448fc661
msgid "Prefer **Pico Enterprise** (USB 网络共享 when possible)"
msgstr "优先使用 **Pico 企业版**（尽可能用 USB 网络共享）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:294
