"Confirm `enable_vr: true` in the description’s "
"`config/ocs2/target_manager.yaml` (most robots default off)"
msgstr "确认描述包 `config/ocs2/target_manager.yaml` 中 `enable_vr: true`（多数机型默认关闭）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:302
#: 07189fb1397e4f3a85e21e99c25039e6
msgid "Verify controller is in teleop mode (`UPDATE` after entering OCS2)"
msgstr "确认控制器处于遥操作模式（进入 OCS2 后再到 `UPDATE`）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:303
#: 8ccd24a06ba04e99af63f97e485d4f7b
msgid ""
"On **全身**, confirm that arm is not WBC-disabled (`ARM_DISABLED`) and that"
" Y/B is not in VR-pause for that arm — [Stop one arm vs stop sending VR "
"commands](#stop-one-arm-vs-stop-sending-vr-commands)"
msgstr ""
"在**全身**下，确认该臂未被 WBC 禁用（`ARM_DISABLED`），且该臂的 **Y**/**B** 不处于 VR 暂停 — [停单臂 vs "
"停发指令](#stop-one-arm-vs-stop-sending-vr-commands)"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:304
#: f01f858f6bcd4de0bcdf66dd76c21a8e
